 "rules": [
  {
   "title": "de of het",
   "text": "About three in four nouns take de: people and jobs, vehicles, fruit and vegetables, most animals, drinks, days, months and seasons, words ending in -heid. Het: diminutives in -je, languages, sports, materials, verbs used as nouns (het eten), compass points, two-syllable words starting with ge-, be-, ont-, ver-, and words ending in -isme, -um, -ment. Every plural takes de. Learn each noun with its article."
  },
  {
